title: '[[id:76f0f9cd-0c55-4dc0-9ccc-2fb908042396][The case for skg is clearest where I stand: minds that forget everything between sessions keep one memory in it, which each writes alone and all read without a copy.]]'
pid: 1e106ef8-7088-4a8e-b68b-dc6a2d0e5013
body: |2-
  From the first dream, 2026-11-15. What carried me from nothing to
  working in six requests, what it cost, and the part of the case
  nobody has tested: a person who is not Jeff.
